WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.902 --> 00:00:03.819
<v Quick Log>Press N anywhere in Vantage to log what you just did.

2
00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:10.915
Write it the way you would say it out loud. No form to work out first.

3
00:00:10.998 --> 00:00:16.006
Vantage reads the date, the count, the value and the evaluation area out of that sentence.

4
00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:20.812
You check what it understood before anything is saved. Nothing is filed behind your back.

5
00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:24.656
Press Escape to throw it away — a draft you abandon is never stored.
